#: 17ffd912b1d54ce6b44182cbdc47ad0c
msgid "TorchScript 工具包"
msgstr "TorchScript Toolkit"

#: 75612f006c4c48ed98cbedb25af0f799
msgid "HamGNN v2.0 的 TorchScript 编译和部署工具包。"
msgstr "The TorchScript compilation and deployment toolkit for HamGNN v2.0."

#: 3a21500abef04537bbc971b57d44cb02
msgid "TorchScript 工具包目前仅支持 HamGNN v2.0 版本。"
msgstr "The TorchScript toolkit currently only supports the HamGNN v2.0 version."

#: eaf00845d52c44df193fa3f384ed465e4
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: 7d4ab2f819fa4228afbdb9053aff0637
msgid "本工具包提供了将 HamGNN v2.0 模型编译为 TorchScript 格式的完整解决方案， 包括模型编译、推理优化和部署支持。"
msgstr "This toolkit provides a complete solution for compiling HamGNN v2.0 models into TorchScript format, including model compilation, inference optimization, and deployment support."

#: 8d2c327045884ff68974e6d33b72a61d
msgid "文档"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: 3034fc398b0447f19cc9f668f484a022
msgid "API 参考"
msgstr "API Reference"

#: 34884dbc5ee5491c8a9f24eadb19cf0e
msgid "主要功能"
msgstr "Main Features"

#: 6b7e8f085ac6465d92b0e6f8e7eb6b49
msgid "**模型编译**: 将 PyTorch Lightning checkpoint 转换为优化的 TorchScript 格式"
msgstr "**Model Compilation**: Converts PyTorch Lightning checkpoints into an optimized TorchScript format."

#: 644cfae3b5d94dd9a1d8b55bc7ad7fb6
msgid "**推理封装**: 提供专门的推理模型架构，优化部署性能"
msgstr "**Inference Wrapper**: Provides a dedicated inference model architecture to optimize deployment performance."

#: 2b4bf64fa43e4f94a8a2a8418dc8d412
msgid "**数据处理**: 统一的数据格式转换和批处理支持"
msgstr "**Data Processing**: Unified data format conversion and batch processing support."

#: 1c7a697fa3534cea972f187de74145f6
msgid "**性能测试**: 完整的性能评估和对比工具"
msgstr "**Performance Testing**: Complete tools for performance evaluation and comparison."

#: d02065e4042e4430989ceedd5eb3b7cf
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: 12180860f4d948f38773040fd4d80517
msgid "更多详细信息请参阅 :doc:`torchscript_user_guide`。"
msgstr "For more details, please see the :doc:`torchscript_user_guide`."

